 * Defect: CheckOrientedShells fails to identify one-sided surface
 * arrangement; non-orientable shell escapes orientation propagation
 * checks and crashes downstream healer. Source: ShapeAnalysis_Shell
 * .CheckOrientedShells line 142 (CheckOrientedShells_at142). */
